  "title": "Vegetable and Feta Latkes",
  "description": "Try this colorful take on traditional potato pancakes. Stir shredded zucchini, potatoes and carrots into a batter of eggs, matzo meal, parsley and feta cheese. Fry until golden brown. You'll love the creamy bite of feta with the tender veggie crunch.",
